  "decision_conditions": [
    "Only amendments which are subject to Schedule 17 approval are considered under this application for non-material changes to the design of the South Ruislip Vent Shaft. The amendments sought for approval relate to:",
    "- Relocated compound boundary fence and gates;",
    "- Additional lighting column/equipment;",
    "- Earthworks to facilitate a small extension of the compound.",
    "The proposals are considered to represent an approval the authority could have given originally and are considered to be non-material. As such, the application is recommended for approval, in accordance with Schedule 17, Part 1, Paragraph 21 (Non-material changes to approvals), of the High Speed Rail (London - West Midlands) Act 2017."
